<title>ITALY: SOCCER SHOWCASE-JUVENTUS ROUT MILAN 6-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-JUVENTUS ROUT MILAN 6-1.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juventus beat AC Milan 6-1 (halftime 2-0) in an Italian Serie A match at the San Siro stadium on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Milan - Simone 75</p>
<p>Juventus - Jugovic 19 and 50, Zidane pen 32, Vieri 71 and 81, Amoruso 73</p>
<p>Attendance: 80,000</p>
